1
00:04:57,142 --> 00:05:03,142
The true story of a mild mannered banker and his magnificent obsession.

2
00:09:54,285 --> 00:10:00,285
Owning Mahowny is a crime, drama, thriller film
directed by Richard Kwietniowski.

3
00:14:51,428 --> 00:14:57,428
Dan Mahowny was a rising star at the Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce.

4
00:19:48,571 --> 00:19:54,571
At twenty-four he was assistant manager of a major branch in
the heart of Toronto's financial district.

5
00:24:45,714 --> 00:24:51,714
To his colleagues he was a workaholic.

6
00:29:42,857 --> 00:29:48,857
To his customers, he was astute, decisive and helpful.

7
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:46,000
To his friends, he was a quiet, but humorous man who
enjoyed watching sports on television.

8
00:39:37,142 --> 00:39:43,142
To his girlfriend, he was shy but engaging.

9
00:44:34,285 --> 00:44:40,285
None of them knew the other side of Dan Mahowny--the side that executed the largest single-handed bank fraud in
Canadian history, grossing over $10 million in eighteen months to feed his gambling obsession.

