16
01:19:14,285 --> 01:19:20,285
Owning Mahowny is a 2003 Canadian film starring Philip Seymour
Hoffman, Minnie Driver, Maury Chaykin and John Hurt.

17
01:24:11,428 --> 01:24:17,428
The film is based on the true story of Brian Molony, a Toronto bank employee who
embezzled more than $10 million to feed his gambling addiction.

18
01:29:08,571 --> 01:29:14,571
Owning Mahowny was named one of the ten best films
of the year by critic Roger Ebert.

19
